 ## Utils
 
 ### `$URL()`
 
+`$URL.query` accepts either a query object or `URLSearchParams`.
+
+```js
+const url = new $URL("/path");
+url.query = new URLSearchParams("tag=one&tag=two");
+url.href; // "/path?tag=one&tag=two"
+```
+
 ### `cleanDoubleSlashes(input)`
 
 Removes double slashes from the URL.
